{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1783","id":4164475701,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p874ONs1","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1783","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1783.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1783.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1783","number":1783,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[9709][P4-06] Reconcile terminal Paper 4 semantic KG","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #1777\n\n## Summary\n\n- reconciles all five visually reviewed Paper 4 Family deltas into terminal Question and QuestionPart disposition/visual ledgers\n- publishes a byte-preserving terminal typed projection, canonical shared semantic registry, compact readback, and immutable content-addressed Family delta bindings\n- authenticates explicit `active -> terminal` and `active -> rollback` chains through the existing #1767 `FutureSemanticKgHarness` schema and API\n- preserves the historical P4-05 active manifest and all five Family sources/deltas byte-for-byte\n\n## Terminal accounting\n\n- Questions: 480 / 480 (`approved` 454, `candidate` 26)\n- QuestionParts: 1,317 / 1,317 (`approved` 767, `candidate` 199, `abstain` 351)\n- score-owning: 967 / 967\n- instruction-only: 350 / 350\n- Topics: 5 / 5\n- visually reviewed Questions / QuestionParts: 480 / 1,317\n- authenticated QP / MS image refs: 703 / 1,019\n- unreadable, missing, or mismatched images: 0\n- QuestionTypes / ProcedureModels / ProcedureInstances: 28 / 23 / 1,458\n- approved ProcedureModels / ProcedureInstances: 22 / 987\n- approved reuse ratio: 44.863636\n- alternative branches: 97 across 54 QuestionParts\n- visual review minutes: 837 (inherited authenticated cumulative P4-05 total)\n- bounded artifacts: 17 files, 22,451,778 bytes\n\nAll terminal hard gates are zero. Candidate and abstain records remain visible but outside approved truth. The candidate-only `resolve_contact_force_system` ProcedureModel remains isolated.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `PYTHONPATH=scripts/vlm python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1777_p4_terminal_reconciliation.py`\n- `PYTHONPATH=scripts/vlm python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1777_p4_terminal_reconciliation.py --check`\n- `python3 -m py_compile scripts/vlm/issue_1777_p4_terminal_reconciliation.py scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1777_p4_terminal_reconciliation.test.py`\n- focused Python matrix: 125 / 125 passed\n  - #1766 producer: 30\n  - #1767 harness: 27\n  - P4-01 through P4-05: 10 + 9 + 12 + 14 + 9\n  - P4-06: 14\n- `git diff --check`\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` (healthy guards; expected warnings for dirty pre-commit worktree and missing pre-push upstream)\n- deterministic 25-QuestionPart risk sample: 50 original QP/MS images reopened across all five Families with no observed contradiction\n\n## Custody and review boundary\n\n- base: `0528b9e5ec31c0f4cfeb383c99859f15f51ea920`\n- base tree: `0fe5ce934ca78082fb8b6c349bf743178c872f32`\n- head: `ce518e067ebef00335779e5fa9126e269f664b67`\n- head tree: `e2c14b6c8765752d77c28965d14af1b0eb9e6e25`\n- historical P4-05 active manifest SHA-256 remains `3101e32214c9e5c41768330e8034f01518698b27dad84e82f1b099878abfd9de`\n- no global structural graph copy, P1/P3 artifact copy, provider call, runtime integration, or remote data write\n\nA fresh independent exact-head visual/semantic/code review is still required before merge. It must cover the deterministic per-Family sample plus all listed alternative branches, disputed ownership records, candidate-only model references, and image-insufficiency exceptions.\n","created_at":"2026-07-29T22:06:01Z","updated_at":"2026-07-29T22:44:40Z","closed_at":"2026-07-29T22:44:40Z","merged_at":"2026-07-29T22:44:39Z","merge_commit_sha":"6babc32cdfc4bae34b8ef421efa7d09d8f68f87f","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1783/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1783/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1783/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/7ff2e05635b92aeedceddf83e42d5c57ff92d8bc","head":{"label":"Samsen879:task/1777-p4-06-terminal-reconciliation","ref":"task/1777-p4-06-terminal-reconciliation","sha":"7ff2e05635b92aeedceddf83e42d5c57ff92d8bc","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/g